This project contains material from the Lightweight Java Game Library (LWJGL):

- LWJGL 3 (https://github.com/LWJGL/lwjgl3), version 3.4.3:
  - the jars this project builds are LWJGL 3's jars with classes added and
    merged in: they contain LWJGL 3's classes, some of them modified;
  - the classes in compat/src/replace are derived from LWJGL 3's sources.
- LWJGL 2 (https://github.com/LWJGL/lwjgl), version 2.9.3:
  - LWJGL 2's sources are included and compiled, unchanged or with small
    changes made as they are extracted at build time: lwjgl_util (but
    org.lwjgl.util.mapped), the OpenAL and OpenCL object models, the input
    classes (Mouse, Keyboard, Controller), parts of the OpenGL package
    (DisplayMode, PixelFormat, ContextAttribs, Drawable, SharedDrawable, the
    debug output callbacks, ...) and some core classes (LWJGLUtil,
    BufferChecks, MemoryUtil, ...);
  - the generated code (compat/src/generated, compat/src/generated-inject)
    reproduces the LWJGL 2.9.3 API (declarations, parameter names and
    constant values) and the Java code of LWJGL 2's generator templates;
  - hand-written code in compat is derived in part from LWJGL 2's sources
    (Display, ContextGL, CallbackUtil, Cursor, ...).

Their licenses follow.

